* Diffractometer BEER, primary part, butterfly moderator
* Generated by: BEER_mcstas.py, version 1.4
* Date: May 14, 2019, 16:41:37
* Template: BEER_primary.instr.template
*
* %Description
* ToF diffractometer BEER@ESS, primary part (source to sample). Employs the ESS_butterfly.comp source (version 2016)
* and permits easy, quasi-automatic setup for pre-selected operation modes. Provides basic beam characteristics on the output.
* The operation modes are:
* 0,   F0,   Maximum intensity, white beam,   never used in experiment
* 1,   PS0,   Maximum intensity,  pulse shaping,   diffraction, max. slit
* 2,   PS1,   High flux, pulse shaping,   in-situ thermo mechanical experiment
* 3,   PS2,   Medium resolution, pulse shaping,   in-situ thermo mechanical experiment
* 4,   PS3,   High resolution, pulse shaping,   in-situ thermo mechanical experiment
* 5,   M0,   Maximum intensity,  modulation,   diffraction, max. slit
* 6,   M1,   High flux, modulation,   strain scanning
* 7,   M2,   Medium resolution, modulation,   strain scanning
* 8,   M3,   High resolution, modulation,   strain scanning
* 9,   IM0,   White beam,   imaging
* 10,   IM1,   High flux, pulse shaping,   imaging, Bragg edge
* 11,   SANS,   White beam,   SANS
* 12,   DS0,   diffraction + SANS, modulation,   in-situ thermomechanical experiment
* 13,   DS1,   diffraction + SANS, pulse shaping,   in-situ thermomechanical experiment

* This instrument model depends on the component Guide_multichannel.comp (J. Saroun, 2016) describing 
* a multichannel neutron guide with semi-transparent blades. It allows to simulate the bi-spectral extraction optics.
* This component is a part of McStas distribution as of ver. 2.5.
* 
* Example: mcrun BEER_primary.instr <parameters=values>
*
* %Parameters
* mode: [] Operation mode (0..13) as defined in the description
* lambda: [AA] Nominal wavelength used to calculate chopper phase
* Lmin: [AA] Minimum wavelength for neutron generation
* Lmax: [AA] Maximum wavelength for neutron generation
* nframes: [] Number of source pulses
* s3w: [m] Sample slit width
* s3h: [m] Sample slit height
* s3dist: [m] Sample slit distance from the sample
* bs_on: [] Sets the bi-spectral switch blades on (1) or off (0)
* tth: [deg] detector take-off angle
* verbose: [] Set to 1 for the list of guides and choppers with parameters after initialization
*
* %Link
*
* %End
*******************************************************************************/

DEFINE INSTRUMENT BEER_primary(int mode=0, lambda=2.0, Lmin=0.2, Lmax=8.2, nframes=1,
 s3w=0.06, s3h=0.06, s3dist=0.05, bs_on=1, verbose=1)

